{%- if request.locale.iso_code contains 'fr' -%}
<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="contact" data-modules="1,2,3,4"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>Contact</h1><p>Parlez-nous du bijou que vous imaginez.</p></header><div class="r-contact-grid"><div><h2>Une question, un bijou, une idée.</h2><p>Pour une taille, un élément, une matière ou une commande existante, écrivez-nous avec les détails disponibles. Une demande sur mesure est ouverte à tous.</p><a class="r-link" href="mailto:contact@suijijewelry.com">contact@suijijewelry.com<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><p class="r-caption">Envoyez votre question directement à l’équipe SUIJI.</p></div>{% form 'contact', id: 'R107Contact1', class: 'r-form' %}<label>Nom (facultatif)<input name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Votre e-mail<input name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>Sujet<select name="contact[Topic]"><option>Bijou ou taille</option><option>Matières</option><option>Commande ou réparation</option><option>Idée sur mesure</option></select></label><label>Bijou / référence de commande (facultatif)<input name="contact[Reference]" data-contact-reference></label><label>Votre question<textarea name="contact[body]" rows="6" required></textarea></label><p class="r-caption">Ajoutez la référence du bijou ou de la commande si vous la connaissez.</p><button class="r-button" type="submit">Envoyer le message</button>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p class="r-form-status" role="status">Merci. Votre message a été envoyé à SUIJI.</p>{% elsif form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}{% endform %}</div></div>
{%- else -%}
<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="contact" data-modules="1,2,3,4"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>Contact</h1><p>Tell us about the piece you have in mind.</p></header><div class="r-contact-grid"><div><h2>A question, a piece, an idea.</h2><p>For sizing, components, materials or an existing order, email us with the details you have. A custom enquiry is open to everyone.</p><a class="r-link" href="mailto:contact@suijijewelry.com">contact@suijijewelry.com<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><p class="r-caption">Send your question directly to the SUIJI team.</p></div>{% form 'contact', id: 'R107Contact1', class: 'r-form' %}<label>Name (optional)<input name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Your email<input name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>Topic<select name="contact[Topic]"><option>Piece or size</option><option>Materials</option><option>Order or repair</option><option>Custom idea</option></select></label><label>Piece / order reference (optional)<input name="contact[Reference]" data-contact-reference></label><label>Your question<textarea name="contact[body]" rows="6" required></textarea></label><p class="r-caption">Include a piece or order reference if you have one.</p><button class="r-button" type="submit">Send message</button>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p class="r-form-status" role="status">Thank you. Your message has been sent to SUIJI.</p>{% elsif form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}{% endform %}</div></div>
{%- endif -%}
